{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-8","kind":"proposition","title":"不等量对应的比例大小关系","englishTitle":"Of unequal magnitudes, the greater has to the same a greater ratio than the less has; and the same has to the less a greater ratio than it has to the greater.","book":5,"number":8,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.8","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.8/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":8,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","contentId":"euclid-5-8","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"65c784bc371373e55b4f9a8b028351a1291888b3ba419aea9db92a2fe5be6ee9","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-8.statement","euclid-5-8.construction.1","euclid-5-8.proof.1","euclid-5-8.proof.2","euclid-5-8.proof.3","euclid-5-8.proof.4","euclid-5-8.proof.5","euclid-5-8.proof.6","euclid-5-8.proof.7","euclid-5-8.proof.8","euclid-5-8.proof.9","euclid-5-8.proof.10","euclid-5-8.proof.11","euclid-5-8.proof.12","euclid-5-8.proof.13","euclid-5-8.proof.14","euclid-5-8.proof.15","euclid-5-8.proof.16","euclid-5-8.proof.17","euclid-5-8.proof.18","euclid-5-8.construction.2","euclid-5-8.proof.19","euclid-5-8.proof.20","euclid-5-8.proof.21","euclid-5-8.proof.22","euclid-5-8.conclusion","euclid-5-8.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-8.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a982ad85bd1e8570a951522be3388fe438e0a7f7dea669afbe123ea0608ce067","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Of unequal magnitudes, the greater has to the same a greater ratio than the less has; and the same has to the less a greater ratio than it has to the greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"数量与数量不相等的,数量必须等于较大的比;数量与数量较少的,必须等于较大的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d5f29cdc5c5de1b2f7fdd46a7c29705a8e94cbc35bb73f20f47508741fc7edf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, C be unequal magnitudes, and let AB be greater; let D be another, chance, magnitude; I say that AB has to D a greater ratio than C has to D, and D has to C a greater ratio than it has to AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,C是不平等的幅度,让AB更大;让D是另一个机会,规模;我说,AB必须达到Da 较大的比比C必须达到D,D比AB必须达到C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b61dc779563d891a5befe01204c80a822608854f2d88404e798156da36243945","citations":["euclid-5-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB is greater than C, let BE be made equal to C; then the less of the magnitudes AE, EB, if multiplied, will sometime be greater than D. [[V. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-5-def-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AB大于C,BE等于C;那么,如果乘以AE,EB,那么数量较小的数量将大于D。 [[V. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-5-def-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"168742413b23645bf9550438960141818ea0573be0d67c69701c2daed78c52d3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"[Case I.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"[案件I]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"71c68e61d73010638d857f456ca7ca6c9040d37025388ff5d2bc33b63cc47711","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let AE be less than EB; let AE be multiplied, and let FG be a multiple of it which is greater than D; then, whatever multiple FG is of AE, let GH be made the same multiple of EB and K of C; and let L be taken double of D, M triple of it, and successive multiples increasing by one, until what is taken is a multiple of D and the first that is greater than K. Let it be taken, and let it be N which is quadruple of D and the first multiple of it that is greather than K."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,AE小于EB;让AE乘以AE,让FG乘以其中的多个,大于D;然后,不管FG是AE,让GH乘以C中的EB和K;让L乘以D,M乘以1,直到D乘以D,第一个大于K。N是D的三倍 其第一个倍数超过K"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7b6f0283785b8b7b8259057ae8bedc6de4e7e6eba6e632aadf82ea84fe97e27d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since K is less than N first, therefore K is not less than M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"K先低于N,K不低于M。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"603007e9ec866e207786e18aaf978dd17d1af2e1931b32b224419fc87dcab445","citations":["euclid-5-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since FG is the same multiple of AE that GH is of EB, therefore FG is the same multiple of AE that FH is of AB. [[V. 1](/principles/euclid-5-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FG是AE的GH的EB的相同倍数,FG是AE的相同倍数,FH是AB的相同倍数。 [[V. 1](/principles/euclid-5-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9f35adf128de7aa13a787a8bf56bdaf2b477f8723377311e8d1875017d0e21eb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But FG is the same multiple of AE that K is of C; therefore FH is the same multiple of AB that K is of C; therefore FH, K are equimultiples of AB, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FG是AE的乘数,K是C;因此,FH是AB的乘数,K是C;FH是AB,C的乘数,同倍数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"774b4ee7d3dba91a2419e44fa65efec0510501627312f3d88903ad2e7d3a3b06","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since GH is the same multiple of EB that K is of C, and EB is equal to C, therefore GH is equal to K."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,GH是EB的乘数,K是C,EB等于C,因此GH等于K。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d7c655a845512194132f9505667dbce3397de9adc3f2596b7b9fcae77c934b50","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But K is not less than M; therefore neither is GH less than M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但K不少于M;因此,两者中也不到GH比M。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"542b0a13382d1a487a4e04400fade001b6b31f7ca580d6321af456b42f858d53","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And FG is greater than D; therefore the whole FH is greater than D, M together."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FG比D强,因此,整个FH加起来大于D,M。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3a43a977544f378334e1c050752539d4b42ee9c6053b1a9b5eb32163e0598223","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But D, M together are equal to N, inasmuch as M is triple of D, and M, D together are quadruple of D, while N is also quadruple of D; whence M, D together are equal to N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但D,M加在一起等于N,M加在一起是D的三倍,M加在一起是D的三倍,D加在一起是D,N加在一起是D的三倍;M加起来是M,D加起来等于N。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c2fa6dc589bfbc0186b4bddc3753ed8138668e09a9f2a83c690b1b9f7708986","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But FH is greater than M, D; therefore FH is in excess of N, while K is not in excess of N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FH超过M,D,FH超过N,K不超过N。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cbfe0b71f4a5856701af98fb3a63bcfe46e23f773e051a82f8e0e67fd8ffd7a2","citations":["euclid-5-def-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And FH, K are equimultiples of AB, C, while N is another, chance, multiple of D; therefore AB has to D a greater ratio than C has to D. [[V. Def. 7](/principles/euclid-5-def-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FH,K是AB,C的同倍数, 而N是另一个机会, 乘以D,AB必须达到Da, C必须达到D。 [[V. Def. 7](/principles/euclid-5-def-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec260dccf91206f7eeeec92f12f1190a72218c834d9018ec1ec877d497f51954","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next, that D also has to C a greater ratio than D has to AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,D 也得达到C a 较大的比 大于 D 等于 AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f393397f7720b10d8759311f23be6074316bd7fb767579110ab4c28d927fe748","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction, we can prove similarly that N is in excess of K, while N is not in excess of FH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,同样的建筑工程,我们同样可以证明,N台超过K台,而N台不超过FH台。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c7ce5f765363e80dbac7afa327fe7a2956fe9b12901bedb2d1e28ce6a41cf7c","citations":["euclid-5-def-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And N is a multiple of D, while FH, K are other, chance, equimultiples of AB, C; therefore D has to C a greater ratio than D has to AB. [[V. Def. 7](/principles/euclid-5-def-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"N是D的倍数, 而FH,K是另一个机会, AB,C中的同倍数; 因此,D必须达到Ca, D必须达到AB。 [[V. Def. 7](/principles/euclid-5-def-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ada8eb099a0d83769212f5f05460937c186ac55f32dae71c12d678dfea7f182","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"[Case 2.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"[案件2]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"73d4bca430d70a992710bf44b6d10fa67231569af474a4e56f6029e98fc062b4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let AE be greater than EB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE比EB还要高"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d653c3295dac5222b6ebafeb0b37535541fa1ef419a62b8615b6f2a1f114d116","citations":["euclid-5-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then the less, EB, if multiplied, will sometime be greater than D. [[V. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-5-def-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"较小数量,如果乘以EB, 则会大于D。 [[V. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-5-def-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":20,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a11c0cb5ce68d05f4cfc7e219258033a5627a183b66f125b932535cb4f42be97","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be multiplied, and let GH be a multiple of EB and greater than D; and, whatever multiple GH is of EB, let FG be made the same multiple of AE, and K of C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它乘以GH乘以EB, 大于D;无论GH乘以EB, FG乘以AE, C乘以K。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b933f738375b5cf8a03c6ed094db089c5239e2db83f53eb86e23bb2eb5686646","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then we can prove similarly that FH, K are equimultiples of AB, C; and, similarly, let N be taken a multiple of D but the first that is greater than FG, so that FG is again not less than M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,我们可以证明,FH,K是AB,C中的同倍数;同样,N是D的倍数,但第一个大于FG,因此,FG不少于M。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34514d665f45171abd6916374fbd499a03188da110bcca972fbb4721aa9118ac","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But GH is greater than D; therefore the whole FH is in excess of D, M, that is, of N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但GH比D强,因此,整个FH超过D,M,即N。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c66e69f517c9f8eb0fd21ae95b54f3ee40107b10feefec165f543aba4848d156","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now K is not in excess of N, inasmuch as FG also, which is greater than GH, that is, than K, is not in excess of N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在K没有超过N,因为FG,即GH,即K,也不超过N。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f0ee0d796a307046efce37f2203688142f0c73a735e504701d36c279887110a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And in the same manner, by following the above argument, we complete the demonstration."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们遵循上述论点,完成示威。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":25,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-8.source","contentId":"euclid-5-8","revisionId":"euclid-5-8@raw-65c784bc371373e5","order":26,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"900edbeb819f4d703214689cafe54788dc533b4258e909e5da5b6396c3a0b1eb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.8/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.8\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-8:euclid-5-def-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-8.proof.1","euclid-5-8.proof.18"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-def-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"V. Def. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-8:euclid-5-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-8.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5